    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106346" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρ-αίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>water,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. [γᾶν</span>], of a river, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				226
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τινά</span>”
				<i>wash, sprinkle with water,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>IT</u>
					54
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>wash oneself, bathe,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρηναμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.750
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				759
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λουτρὰ ὑδράνασθαι χροΐ</span>
			<i>pour</i> water <i>over one's</i> body, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				157
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδραίνειν χοάς τινι</span>
			<i>pour</i> libations to . . , <i><span class="en">
